obj_id: RegionalProfitabilityDiscovery-1e09cdaa
liveboard:
  name: Regional Profitability Discovery
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: fa2d1139-643e-4b46-a04f-53eeadf3a65c
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • West region achieves highest profit margin at 14.9% vs company average of 12.5%
        • Central region underperforms with only 7.9% profit margin despite $501K in sales
        • Regional efficiency gap: Central generates 28% more revenue than South but similar profit levels
        • Overall profit margin of 12.5% suggests high cost structure across operations

        Recommendations:
        • Investigate Central region cost structure and pricing strategy to improve 7.9% margin
        • Replicate West region best practices across other territories
        • Focus growth investments in West region given superior 14.9% profitability
